    <title>宝岛老师图鉴：青春里的铁拳教育和温柔治愈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a36d494608f69578bd74344</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a36d494608f69578bd74344</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Jun 2026 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期介绍：借着热播韩剧《铁拳教育》，学姐学妹来了一次宝岛老师盘点，细数求学时期形形色色的师长们。高压体罚，反差满满的各科老师，还有被调皮学生气到不行的修女，还有令人留下心理阴影或被治愈的瞬间，经历过的酸甜苦辣终究会化作成长的一部分，也沉淀成了青春印记。也欢迎大家在评论区一起聊聊你们最印象深刻的老师哦～</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="151">02:31</a> 超火的韩剧《铁拳教育》到底有多爽？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">03:19</a> 学妹不爱复仇剧的理由</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="422">07:02</a> 此处有雷，《铁拳教育》剧情</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="676">11:16</a> 聊聊那些一辈子忘不掉的老师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 幼儿园左右手地狱：老师崩溃，学妹怀疑人生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="943">15:43</a> 学姐哥哥的国文老师，美丽开朗，却突然离世</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1233">20:33</a> 在清晨校车上，学姐第一堂生命教育课</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">21:21</a> 学妹的音乐老师，审美极好</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1403">23:23</a> 学妹国中第一次听Chet Baker，打开新世界的大门</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1674">27:54</a> 聊着聊着，早已忘记的名字都自己回来了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1738">28:58</a> 载学姐回家的小学老师，也是一种woman helps woman</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2124">35:24</a> 当数学差生遇到超凶的数学老师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> 老师是骂人天才，但侮辱性极强</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2477">41:17</a> 让学姐PTSD的体罚套餐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2601">43:21</a> 分数真的能打出来吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2872">47:52</a> 体罚或许只是大人最省力的失控方式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3030">50:30</a> 不打不骂还能教吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3105">51:45</a> 英语老师反差登场：臭脸但很强</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 学妹的班导，整天只想打篮球</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3266">54:26</a> 同理心教学翻车现场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3318">55:18</a> 学妹被通知“你们放牛班的”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3415">56:55</a> 不要相信别人给你贴标签</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3469">57:49</a> 教会学校特供记忆：修女、圣歌比赛、生命伦理三件套</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3532">58:52</a> 面对初中生，修女也疯狂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3589">59:49</a> 圣歌DNA动了，学姐张口就来</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3650">60:50</a> 生命教育课：内容模糊，但留下的句子很清晰</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3812">63:32</a> 从朱德庸漫画里走出来的女老师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4069">67:49</a> 玉树临风的数学老师，少女们的crush</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4225">70:25</a> 让同学疯狂迷恋还偷拍的帅气教官</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4331">72:11</a> 学妹带流浪猫到学校，老师当场掉麦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4461">74:21</a> 校刊社特权：午休可以在校园横着走</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4609">76:49</a> 大学篇急转直下：一位差点毕业不了的男同学</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4683">78:03</a> 被老师灌醉——真实发生的师生权力侵害</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4800">80:00</a> 性平会之后，老师被辞退</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4895">81:35</a> 老师身份，不等于天然安全</span></p><p><span>Bgm：Chihuahua / Wah Wah Wah </span></p><p></p>]]></description>
