    <title>听伍佰也看鲁迅，台团里的“怪味豆”百合花来了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69f482ef78d33cb2c4f90926</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69f482ef78d33cb2c4f90926</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 11:01:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期介绍】：缘分这道桥，真呀真美妙！本期嘉宾是金曲宝藏台团百合花！和学姐妹的相识要从泰国说起…….一个鲁迅狂魔伍佰爱好者开始玩乐队会发生什么，两个火象星座和一个土象星座会碰撞出怎样怪味上头的音乐！百合花乐团大陆首演，就在5月战马音乐节！都去看！！</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/niDbWCTFgpczFZvdqSoaVefU4k8r.jpg"></figure><p><span>另外开头提到的战马音乐节线下播客节【热带电台】也不要错过～</span><br><span>地点：大华城市表演艺术中心·环形剧场</span><br><span>5月10日 西海之声X马上电波</span><br><span>5月15日 百合花乐团X</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69f35cd1b39400b49345c2ab" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69f35cd1b39400b49345c2ab"><span>拍脑门儿 </span></a><br><span>5月16日 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/611c9d18a45acc2ae7b0568a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/611c9d18a45acc2ae7b0568a"><span>安全出口</span></a><span>X</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/659ffbd9a16288147d0f5a10" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/659ffbd9a16288147d0f5a10"><span>天糖电影苑</span></a><br><span>5月17日 宝岛曼波X</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e285858418a84a04627c09e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e285858418a84a04627c09e"><span>优斯迪巴</span></a><span>薛哥 </span><br><span>温馨提示：购买战马音乐节任一场次就可以免费参与播客节活动，只想参加播客节也可单独购票哦～</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nqIkUGSdYhkqPEoLBz7J6AZD-NBD.jpg"></figure><p></p><p><span>Shownotes</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 台湾长发男在上海买旗袍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a> 有口皆碑的宝藏台团</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> “好像必须要成功，大家才会觉得有趣”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 学妹的新副业：电容笔</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 百合花如何成团</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 小时候听太多西洋音乐的后遗症</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 伍佰、黄俊雄与布袋戏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a> 做传统音乐像是疯狂的麦克斯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 主唱奕硕是鲁迅的狂热粉丝</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> 拿到金曲奖是什么感受</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 有金主爸爸就要大方亮出来！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a> 当两个火象遇见一个土象星座</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3780">63:00</a> 练团就和谈恋爱一样？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4380">73:00</a> 听百合花有什么好处？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4740">79:00</a> 去百合花的现场记得带上直笛！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4800">80:00</a> 一人推荐一首百合花乐团必听曲！</span></p><p><span>BGM: </span></p><p><span>百合花乐团 - 万事美妙</span></p><p><span>百合花乐团 - 烧金蕉</span></p><p><span>百合花乐团 - 医生</span></p>]]></description>
