  <item>
    <title>北京小老虎又见台湾学姐妹：你们的家让我满电！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e9ab411d989496e74fb825</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69e9ab411d989496e74fb825</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 23 Apr 2026 05:59:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期介绍】七星连珠之夜的那个男人又归来了！本期欢迎小老虎（@</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67091e6e88064386beca0b78" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67091e6e88064386beca0b78"><span>一个玩说唱的</span></a><span>）！本期聊聊虎哥去台北演出的那些事儿，从高雄的海风到和音乐人那些奇奇妙妙的碰撞相遇，还有让虎哥“闭麦”的说唱乩童，以及形形色色的美食……一切充满新鲜和治愈，当然旅行的意义最难忘的也许还是人类本身，以及不断探索出寻的想象力。收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><p><span>拜了喂，5月我们即将有线下见面的机会，请大家最近多多关注战马时代公众号~~</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shownotes</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 《排球少年》在小老虎心中很权威</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> 一个很会表达的人在播客中做主持是什么体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 高雄就像是citypop的封面！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 世界末日，小老虎想在这里度过</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a> 学姐力荐宝岛爆款面膜</span></p><span></span><p><span>小老虎在台北的“羊头虎肉”演出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> 宝岛观众评小老虎：你的演出很延年益寿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1987">33:07</a> 跟张悬隔空致意，陈娴静惊喜助阵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">36:50</a> 嘻哈歌手私下在聊什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> 让小老虎抢不到话筒的说唱乩童</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3320">55:20</a> 跟陈珊妮一起玩极限项目</span></p><span></span><p><span>台湾风景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a> 台湾的谐音梗多夸张</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3660">61:00</a> “漫无目的”的说话方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4020">67:00</a> 不吃香菜的人也会爱上宜兰这款冰淇淋卷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4320">72:00</a> 台湾的豆腐乳让人变成俘虏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4620">77:00</a> 夜市、“蒙古火锅”和石头烤肉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5040">84:00</a> 北京未来最好吃的台湾菜，掌勺人是学妹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5400">90:00</a> 旅行的意义，尽在不言中</span></p><span></span><p><br><span>文案：小熊猫</span><br><span>BGM: 我想我会让你轻松-小老虎/Soulspeak</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6454bcbc306513184c1d8825/ljMzw9KWAw4uSPf7cKG8Ts9Jy5Yk.m4a" length="91178466" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:33:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpqnk9PJLc9T93L8EQJEvytpRx4V.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>从周杰伦田馥甄聊起：那些年的意难平CP里，主角竟是我自己</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c0ab682d318777c93bfa45</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c0ab682d318777c93bfa45</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Mar 2026 03:40:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期介绍】本期是和好朋友《武湖四海》两位主播大武、太太再串台！最近大家突然开始回磕周杰伦和田馥甄的旧糖，周侯恋、锋菲恋、秦汉林青霞、周星驰朱茵……那些年的意难平CP来来去去，最大的主角其实都是我们自己，时而我们也会变成那个说故事的人，怀念很美，此刻最美！想知道大家最意难忘的CP是谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span>那些年的意难平CP</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 老粉在周杰伦结婚的第二天，去了威廉古堡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 周杰伦和田馥甄到底有多锤？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 全台湾人都是周侯恋的见证者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 徐若瑄与《可爱女人》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> 田馥甄与《无人知晓》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a>“田馥甄周杰伦昆凌的三人戏”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> 那些轰轰烈烈的CP们：锋菲、贾斯汀赛琳娜、赵薇苏有朋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 无人在意的角落里学妹还在关心昆凌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2370">39:30</a> 为什么我们很喜欢磕过期CP?</span></p><span></span><p><span>那些年我们自己的“意难平”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a> 大学白月光，只娶本地人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 距离结婚一步之遥的伊朗男</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3150">52:30</a> 学妹那段“有毒但上头”的恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3750">62:30</a> 学姐在北京的 summer love</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4380">73:00</a> 学妹偶遇宋冬野：宋老师好！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4680">78:00</a> 视奸前任手滑被拉黑是一种什么体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4860">81:00</a> 上世纪的意难平CP：秦汉林青霞、周星驰朱茵</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：小熊猫</span></p>]]></description>
