  <item>
    <title>学姐学妹返台过年记：“我妈算我难结婚，我爸让我嫁美国”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69a82c07fccfedb291117416</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69a82c07fccfedb291117416</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Mar 2026 13:16:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期介绍】新年愉快！本期《宝岛曼波》聊聊游子er过年回家必被问三件套：婚恋生娃或许还有回家找工作。除了发现彼此已经成为对方最特殊的存在，还发觉每一位读者都是学姐妹的“互联网心理医生”！隔着屏幕我们彼此分享与治愈着，大步向前走！干杯！🍻</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjsMofpPYY2s-UdvhrI8PuPUYIAe.jpg"></figure><p><span>【Shownotes】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 到底什么是Quality Time？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 爸爸带学姐的“垦丁VIP游’</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> “在外漂久了，回家有种原罪感”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 有一个会看命盘的妈妈是什么体验？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> 当学妹被妈妈算出“十年内难结婚”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 台湾年度抽象新闻，主角105岁</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2970">49:30</a> 学姐爸爸的另类催婚</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> 当学妹和妈妈聊婚育</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> 孝顺，更重要的是“顺”？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">64:00</a> 爸爸用佛法开解学姐职场难题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4260">71:00</a> Chat GPT比人更适合当心理医生？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4380">73:00</a> 小剧场：学妹模仿ABC</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4800">80:00</a> 学姐那封写哭爸爸的休学信</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5400">90:00</a> 乡愁：对家，身体的反应总是很诚实</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6000">100:00</a> 情绪价值，在最亲的人面前失灵</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6300">105:00</a> 开不了口的，写进命盘和长信里</span></p><p><span>BGM: 杜甫他不知道恐龙曾经存在—someshiit山姆</span></p><p><span>文案：小熊猫</span></p>]]></description>
