    <title>宝岛曼波年度总结：2025的重要瞬间，都有你在身边！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/696c706bef1cf272a7feccd4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">696c706bef1cf272a7feccd4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Jan 2026 05:49:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期介绍】听到这一期的时候，就已经收到宝岛曼波对大家的新年祝福了！2025年终盘点，好笑的荒谬的，难忘的时刻太多也是种甜蜜的烦恼，复盘回过头来发现生命最重要的瞬间，都有你参与身边！希望2026大家敢想，敢梦，因为真的会实现！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> 学姐诡辩开场：忘记过去=活在当下</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025最累的瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> 学姐在异国他乡，独自遭遇工作最重大危机，</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> “心里有过不去的坎，要多和亲近的人聊天”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> “不要把命运拟人化”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 演出前一天乐队提出想换成员，学妹懵了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a> 天大的事情，被刘老师的雪茄和威士忌化解了</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025最快乐时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1575">26:15</a> 学姐妹首次过二人世界，马来西亚太Chill了！（可移步</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6862953abef90978ecac0d04" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6862953abef90978ecac0d04"><span>马上电波</span></a><span>听我们的游记）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 年度人生时刻：过年学妹造访学姐家打麻将</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025最喜欢的电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 学妹强推这部六小时宫崎骏《幽灵公主》纪录片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 流行语的诞生，是对抗AI算法的利器</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2960">49:20</a> 学姐无删减复述《信条》剧情挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 彩蛋：学姐看电影有多急</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025最喜欢的电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a> 学姐妹0元闯VIP客户体验，感谢艺人！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3990">66:30</a> 音乐产业大会上在厕所遇见陈珊妮，学妹紧急夹断！</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025的新乐子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4440">74:00</a> 在大跳台看苏翊鸣滑雪，刺激</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4800">80:00</a> 学妹正在解锁俄语技能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5040">84:00</a> 学会弹舌音接吻会比较厉害吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025最喜欢的一期节目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5220">87:00</a> 那一夜七星连珠，和小老虎火花四溅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5400">90:00</a> 爆款节目北漂台妹租房，回cue一下</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69540c5f14db1df9ef9f33ae" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69540c5f14db1df9ef9f33ae"><span>“小房间”</span></a><span>的推荐！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5610">93:30</a> 学姐妹的聊天王牌是“氛围感”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5780">96:20</a> 串台</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/691d5c846018cc2c988f462a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/691d5c846018cc2c988f462a"><span>“武湖四海”</span></a><span>聊迷信</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025给对方的一句话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5790">96:30</a> 学姐希望学妹“相信你自己是最好的”！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6330">105:30</a> 学妹to学姐：你什么都不缺，就缺这个</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6600">110:00</a> 2026新年期望</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：小熊猫</span><br><span>BGM：启示路-陈珊妮</span></p>]]></description>
